   2  GTR+F+I+R5       -10017.389   20070.779 + 6.95e-310   20074.199 + 6.95e-310   20131.782 + 6.9e-310
   3  TIM3+F+I+R2       -1640.045    3300.091 + 6.95e-310    3301.148 + 6.95e-310    3333.981 + 6.9e-310
   4  TPM2u+R5          -6131.931   12285.863 + 6.95e-310   12286.380 + 6.95e-310   12332.697 + 6.9e-310
   5  TVM+F+I+R5       -16227.685   32489.371 + 6.95e-310   32491.889 + 6.95e-310   32549.967 + 6.9e-310

AIC, w-AIC   : Akaike information criterion scores and weights.
AICc, w-AICc : Corrected AIC scores and weights.
BIC, w-BIC   : Bayesian information criterion scores and weights.

Plus signs denote the 95% confidence sets.
Minus signs denote significant exclusion.

